医疗免责声明 / Medical Disclaimer

本应用是个人记录工具，不提供医疗诊断、治疗建议或用药指导。
应用内的孕周推算、预产期估算与各项统计仅供个人整理参考，
不能替代医生的专业判断。如有健康问题，请咨询执业医师。

This application is a personal record-keeping tool. It does not provide
medical diagnosis, treatment advice, or medication guidance. Gestational age
and due-date estimates are for personal organization only and must not
replace professional medical judgement.
